cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use structured-address-fix-mcp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "structured-address-fix-mcp: Model Context Protocol server for ISO 20022 postal addresses"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server exposing the structured-address-fix
  library to AI agents: thirteen tools that classify a postal address as
  structured, hybrid or unstructured, assess it or every addressed party in
  a pacs.008 / pain.001 message against a scheme policy, and remediate it
  into the structured form the November 2026 cutover requires.
authors:
